{"sectionId":"bio-methods/molecular","items":[{"id":"bio-methods--molecular-k001","sectionId":"bio-methods/molecular","unitId":"bio-methods","subject":"biology","text":"PCR은 변성, primer 결합, 신장 단계를 반복해 목표 DNA를 증폭한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"bio-methods--molecular-k002","sectionId":"bio-methods/molecular","unitId":"bio-methods","subject":"biology","text":"이상적 효율에서 n회 반복 후 약 2ⁿ배 증가하나 실제로 효율과 plateau가 존재한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"bio-methods--molecular-k003","sectionId":"bio-methods/molecular","unitId":"bio-methods","subject":"biology","text":"RT-PCR은 역전사 후 PCR을 뜻하며 real-time qPCR과 구분한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"bio-methods--molecular-k004","sectionId":"bio-methods/molecular","unitId":"bio-methods","subject":"biology","text":"qPCR의 Ct/Cq는 초기 주형량과 역관계다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"bio-methods--molecular-k005","sectionId":"bio-methods/molecular","unitId":"bio-methods","subject":"biology","text":"기준 유전자와 효율 가정을 사용하는 ΔΔCt 방식에서 상대 발현량은 2^(−ΔΔCt)로 근사한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"bio-methods--molecular-k006","sectionId":"bio-methods/molecular","unitId":"bio-methods","subject":"biology","text":"Southern blot은 DNA, Northern은 RNA, Western은 단백질을 검출한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"bio-methods--molecular-k007","sectionId":"bio-methods/molecular","unitId":"bio-methods","subject":"biology","text":"SDS-PAGE는 대체로 크기에 따라 단백질을 분리하며 환원제는 이황화결합을 절단한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"bio-methods--molecular-k008","sectionId":"bio-methods/molecular","unitId":"bio-methods","subject":"biology","text":"제한효소와 DNA ligase를 이용한 cloning에서 vector는 복제원점·선택표지 등을 갖는다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"bio-methods--molecular-k009","sectionId":"bio-methods/molecular","unitId":"bio-methods","subject":"biology","text":"Sanger sequencing은 ddNTP에 의한 사슬 종결을 이용한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"bio-methods--molecular-k010","sectionId":"bio-methods/molecular","unitId":"bio-methods","subject":"biology","text":"CRISPR-Cas9은 guide RNA와 PAM 조건에 따라 DNA 절단을 유도하고 세포의 복구 경로로 변화를 만든다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"bio-methods--molecular-k011","sectionId":"bio-methods/molecular","unitId":"bio-methods","subject":"biology","text":"PCR primer는 목표 영역의 서로 반대 가닥에 결합한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"bio-methods--molecular-k012","sectionId":"bio-methods/molecular","unitId":"bio-methods","subject":"biology","text":"Western band 강도는 로딩 대조군 및 검출 선형범위를 고려한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"bio-methods--molecular-k013","sectionId":"bio-methods/molecular","unitId":"bio-methods","subject":"biology","text":"qPCR에서 효율이 이상적이면 Ct 차이 1은 약 2배 주형량 차이에 해당한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"bio-methods--molecular-k014","sectionId":"bio-methods/molecular","unitId":"bio-methods","subject":"biology","text":"결과의 상관관계만으로 인과를 단정하지 않는다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"bio-methods--molecular-k015","sectionId":"bio-methods/molecular","unitId":"bio-methods","subject":"biology","text":"Northern blot이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]}]}